      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the Council of Ministers as shown in Annexure 'A' have relinquished their respective offices with effect from the forenoon of 14th January, 1980."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
